cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Simulator: Autonomous Simulation and Parameter Search System for Droplet Contact Angles"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: miandui-wubo
contact:
  - email: zhenyuwang@ss.pku.edu.cn
repository-code: "https://github.com/miandui-wubo/simulator-open"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the manuscript "Measurement-operator auditing in an
  automated gallium droplet simulation and derivative-free optimization
  workflow" (under review). The workflow couples an LLM multi-agent
  simulation assistant with COMSOL/MATLAB co-simulation and derivative-free
  optimizers (Bayesian optimization, genetic algorithm and particle swarm
  optimization) to invert 13 physical parameters so that simulated droplet
  contact angles match experimental measurements, with point-cloud
  contact-angle calculation (PCA) as post-processing.
keywords:
  - COMSOL
  - contact angle
  - gallium
  - liquid metal
  - derivative-free optimization
  - Bayesian optimization
  - genetic algorithm
  - particle swarm optimization
  - LLM agents
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
